{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/consultations/local-government-reorganisation-in-essex-southend-on-sea-and-thurrock","content_id":"7e0b27fb-356b-4861-82b2-f393f39b8141","description":"This consultation seeks views on the local government reorganisation proposals we have received from councils in Essex, Southend-on-Sea and Thurrock.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"html","command_paper_number":"","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9228614","isbn":"","title":"Proposals for local government reorganisation in Essex, Southend-on-Sea and Thurrock","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"/government/consultations/local-government-reorganisation-in-essex-southend-on-sea-and-thurrock/proposals-for-local-government-reorganisation-in-essex-southend-on-sea-and-thurrock"},{"accessible":false,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alternativeformats@communities.gov.uk","attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":690356,"filename":"Summary_and_analysis_of_consultation_responses_Essex.pdf","id":"9228615","isbn":"","number_of_pages":48,"title":"Essex, Southend-on-Sea and Thurrock: Summary and analysis of consultation responses","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69c3ab4f3ed0546101e0dc3c/Summary_and_analysis_of_consultation_responses_Essex.pdf"},{"attachment_type":"html","command_paper_number":"","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9228618","isbn":"","title":"Essex, Southend-on-Sea and Thurrock: Summary and analysis of consultation responses","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"/government/consultations/local-government-reorganisation-in-essex-southend-on-sea-and-thurrock/outcome/essex-southend-on-sea-and-thurrock-summary-and-analysis-of-consultation-responses"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>We are seeking views on the proposals submitted by councils for the reorganisation of local government in Essex, Southend-on-Sea and Thurrock.</p>\n\n<p>Responses to this consultation will inform our decision on which proposal, if any, to implement.</p>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"HTML version of government response added.","public_timestamp":"2026-04-22T15:40:55Z"},{"note":"Government response added.","public_timestamp":"2026-03-25T13:11:50Z"},{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2025-11-19T15:00:00Z"}],"closing_date":"2026-01-11T23:59:00.000+00:00","emphasised_organisations":["1390d07f-12b3-4f55-9dd5-fec5fd9e3649"],"featured_attachments":["9228614"],"final_outcome_attachments":["9228615","9228618"],"final_outcome_detail":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>​The Secretary of State for Housing, Communities and Local Government has decided to implement, subject to Parliamentary approval, the proposal for 5 unitary councils to be established in Essex, Southend-on-Sea and Thurrock.</p>\n\n<p>This proposal was submitted by:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <p>Basildon Borough Council</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>Brentwood Borough Council</li>\n  <li>Castle Point Borough Council</li>\n  <li>Chelmsford City Council</li>\n  <li>Colchester City Council</li>\n  <li>Harlow Council</li>\n  <li>Maldon District Council</li>\n  <li>Southend-on-Sea Council</li>\n  <li>Tendring District Council</li>\n  <li>Uttlesford District Council</li>\n</ul>\n</div>","first_public_at":"2025-11-19T15:00:00.000+00:00","national_applicability":{"england":{"applicable":true,"label":"England"},"northern_ireland":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Northern Ireland"},"scotland":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Scotland"},"wales":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Wales"}},"opening_date":"2025-11-19T15:00:00.000+00:00","political":true,"tags":{"browse_pages":[]}},"document_type":"consultation_outcome","first_published_at":"2025-11-19T15:00:03+00:00","links":{"available_trans